		"description": "<p>Calling upon shadows and the dead, you afflict the world with necromantic power and draw up the dead to do your horrible bidding. Choose five squares within 60ft. These squares become occupied with shadowy apparitions that you have minimal control over. but they do not fill the space. For the purposes of determining whether an opponent provokes an opportunity attack, you are considered to occupy the chosen five squares in addition to your own. At the end of each of your turns while maintaining this stance, you can change the five chosen squares to any configuration you like. Each apparition has an AC equal to your Maneuver DC and 10 HP. Once destroyed, they cannot be reconstituted until you use this maneuver again.</p>",
